&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mathematical constants.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>rand</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/math/rand/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/math/rand/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文：&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/math/rand@go1.24.2"&gt;https://pkg.go.dev/math/rand@go1.24.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package rand implements pseudo-random number generators unsuitable for security-sensitive work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	&lt;code&gt;rand&lt;/code&gt;包实现了伪随机数生成器，不适合用于安全敏感的工作。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Random numbers are generated by a &lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/math/rand@go1.20.1#Source"&gt;Source&lt;/a&gt;, usually wrapped in a &lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/math/rand@go1.20.1#Rand"&gt;Rand&lt;/a&gt;. Both types should be used by a single goroutine at a time: sharing among multiple goroutines requires some kind of synchronization.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>